{
  "Scenes.Maddie.BakeryEpilogue.EntersBakery": "As soon as you enter the bakery, one of the waitresses pulls you aside. She positively beams as she hands you a note and says, [say: One of our chefs wanted me to give you this. I didn't even know he could write! I mean, where does a minotaur learn to handle a pen?] You smirk, waving her away before you open up the minotaur's note.[pg]"
