  "Scenes.Maddie.HandOverIngredientsItBeBakingTimeYo.GrabsWhisk": "Grabbing a whisk, the bull-man starts stirring the sex-filled dough with vigor, mixing the thickening blend hard enough to make his biceps ripple. A moment later, he lifts the bowl one-handed and pulls out a giant, novelty cupcake mold from the counter. After filling the mold, the chef throws it onto his burly shoulder and grabs a sack of actual icing. A terse grunt instructs, [say: Wait at tables. You can try some when done.] "
